#: ../../docs/about/system_requirements.rst:66
msgid ""
"If your x86_64 CPU does not support SSE4.2, you can still run the 32-bit "
"Godot executable which only has a SSE2 requirement (all x86_64 CPUs support "
"SSE2)."
