#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:198
msgid ""
"As mentioned in the **note** above, open the Godot Editor and create a Godot "
"project directly (no subfolder) in the ``assets`` directory of the Android "
"application project"
msgstr ""
"위의 **참고**에서 언급한 대로 Godot 편집기를 열고 Android 애플리케이션 프로젝"
"트의 ``assets`` 디렉터리에 Godot 프로젝트를 직접 생성합니다(하위 폴더 없음)."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:200
msgid ""
"See the sample app's `Godot project <https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-Android-"
"Samples/tree/master/apps/gltf_viewer/src/main/assets>`_ for reference"
msgstr ""
"샘플 앱의 `Godot 프로젝트 <https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-Android-Samples/"
"tree/master/apps/gltf_viewer/src/main/assets>`_를 참고하세요."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:202
msgid "Configure the Godot project as desired"
msgstr "빌드 커스터마이징하기"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:204
msgid ""
"Make sure the `orientation <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/"
"class_projectsettings.html#class-projectsettings-property-display-window-"
"handheld-orientation>`_ set for the Godot project matches the one set in the "
"Android app's manifest"
msgstr ""
"Godot 프로젝트의 `방향 <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/"
"class_projectsettings.html#class-projectsettings-property-display-window-"
"handheld-orientation>`_ 설정이 Android 앱 매니페스트의 설정과 일치하는지 확인"
"하세요."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:205
msgid ""
"For Android, make sure `textures/vram_compression/import_etc2_astc <https://"
"docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_projectsettings.html#class-"
"projectsettings-property-rendering-textures-vram-compression-import-etc2-"
"astc>`_ is set to `true`"
msgstr ""
"Android의 경우 `textures/vram_compression/import_etc2_astc <https://"
"docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_projectsettings.html#class-"
"projectsettings-property-rendering-textures-vram-compression-import-etc2-"
"astc>`_이 `true`로 설정되어 있는지 확인하세요."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:207
msgid "Update the Godot project script logic as needed"
msgstr "필요에 따라 Godot 프로젝트 스크립트 논리를 업데이트하세요."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:209
msgid ""
"For the sample app, the `script logic <https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-"
"Android-Samples/blob/master/apps/gltf_viewer/src/main/assets/main.gd>`_ "
"queries for the runtime ``GodotPlugin`` instance and uses it to register for "
"signals fired by the app logic"
msgstr ""
"샘플 앱의 경우 `스크립트 로직 <https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-Android-"
"Samples/blob/master/apps/gltf_viewer/src/main/assets/main.gd>`_은 런타임 "
"``GodotPlugin`` 인스턴스를 쿼리하고 이를 사용하여 앱 로직에 의해 실행된 시그"
"널에 등록합니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:210
msgid ""
"The app logic fires a signal every time an item is selected in the list. The "
"signal contains the filepath of the glTF model, which is used by the "
"``gdscript`` logic to render the model."
msgstr ""
"앱 로직은 목록에서 항목이 선택될 때마다 시그널를 실행합니다. 시그널에는 "
"``gdscript`` 논리에서 모델을 렌더링하는 데 사용되는 glTF 모델의 파일 경로가 "
"포함되어 있습니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:244
msgid "3. Build and run the app"
msgstr "Android SDK 다운로드하기"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:246
msgid ""
"Once you complete configuration of your Godot project, build and run the "
"Android app. If set up correctly, the host Activity will initialize the "
"embedded Godot Engine on startup. The Godot Engine will check the ``assets`` "
"directory for project files to load (unless configured to look for a ``main "
"pack``), and will proceed to run the project."
msgstr ""
"Godot 프로젝트 구성을 완료한 후 Android 앱을 빌드하고 실행하세요. 올바르게 설"
"정되면 호스트 활동은 시작 시 내장된 Godot 엔진을 초기화합니다. Godot 엔진은 "
"로드할 프로젝트 파일에 대해 ``assets`` 디렉터리를 확인하고(``main pack``를 찾"
"도록 구성되지 않은 경우) 프로젝트 실행을 진행합니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:250
msgid ""
"While the app is running on device, you can check `Android logcat <https://"
"developer.android.com/studio/debug/logcat>`_ to investigate any errors or "
"crashes."
msgstr ""
"앱이 기기에서 실행되는 동안 `Android logcat <https://developer.android.com/"
"studio/debug/logcat>`_을 확인하여 오류나 충돌을 조사할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_library.rst:252
msgid ""
"For reference, check the `build and install instructions <https://github.com/"
"m4gr3d/Godot-Android-Samples/blob/master/apps/gltf_viewer/README.md>`_ for "
"the GLTF Viewer sample app."
msgstr ""
"참고로 GLTF 뷰어 샘플 앱에 대한 `빌드 및 설치 지침 <https://github.com/"
"m4gr3d/Godot-Android-Samples/blob/master/apps/gltf_viewer/README.md>`_을 확인"
"하세요."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:9
msgid ""
"Android plugins are powerful tools to extend the capabilities of the Godot "
"engine by tapping into the functionality provided by Android platforms and "
"ecosystem."
msgstr ""
"Android 플러그인은 Android 플랫폼과 생태계에서 제공하는 기능을 활용하여 "
"Godot 엔진의 기능을 확장하는 강력한 도구입니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:12
msgid ""
"For example in Godot 4, Android plugins are used to support multiple Android-"
"based XR platforms without encumbering the core codebase with vendor "
"specific code or binaries."
msgstr ""
"예를 들어 Godot 4에서 Android 플러그인은 공급업체별 코드나 바이너리로 인해 핵"
"심 코드베이스를 방해하지 않고 여러 Android 기반 XR 플랫폼을 지원하는 데 사용"
"됩니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:16
msgid "Android plugin"
msgstr "Android"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:18
msgid ""
"**Version 1 (v1)** of the Android plugin system was introduced in Godot 3 "
"and compatible with Godot 4.0 and 4.1. That version allowed developers to "
"augment the Godot engine with Java, Kotlin and native functionality."
msgstr ""
"**버전 1(v1)** Android 플러그인 시스템은 Godot 3에 도입되었으며 Godot 4.0 및 "
"4.1과 호환됩니다. 이 버전을 통해 개발자는 Java, Kotlin 및 기본 기능으로 "
"Godot 엔진을 강화할 수 있었습니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:21
msgid ""
"Starting in Godot 4.2, Android plugins built on the v1 architecture are now "
"deprecated. Instead, Godot 4.2 introduces a new **Version 2 (v2)** "
"architecture for Android plugins."
msgstr ""
"Godot 4.2부터 v1 아키텍처를 기반으로 구축된 Android 플러그인은 더 이상 사용되"
"지 않습니다. 대신 Godot 4.2는 Android 플러그인을 위한 새로운 **버전 2(v2)** "
"아키텍처를 도입합니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:25
msgid "v2 Architecture"
msgstr "텍스처"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:29
msgid ""
"Godot Android plugin leverages the :ref:`Gradle build system "
"<doc_android_gradle_build>`."
msgstr ""
"Godot Android 플러그인은 :ref:`Gradle 빌드 시스템 <doc_android_gradle_build>`"
"을 활용합니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:32
msgid ""
"Building on the previous v1 architecture, Android plugins continue to be "
"derived from the `Android archive library <https://developer.android.com/"
"studio/projects/android-library#aar-contents>`_."
msgstr ""
"이전 v1 아키텍처를 기반으로 하는 Android 플러그인은 `Android 아카이브 라이브"
"러리 <https://developer.android.com/studio/projects/android-library#aar-"
"contents>`_에서 계속 파생됩니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:35
msgid ""
"At its core, a Godot Android plugin v2 is an Android library with a "
"dependency on the :ref:`Godot Android library <doc_android_library>`, and a "
"custom Android library manifest."
msgstr ""
"기본적으로 Godot Android 플러그인 v2는 :ref:`Godot Android library "
"<doc_android_library>`에 종속된 Android 라이브러리와 사용자 정의 Android 라이"
"브러리 매니페스트입니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:38
msgid ""
"This architecture allows Android plugins to extend the functionality of the "
"engine with:"
msgstr ""
"이 아키텍처를 사용하면 Android 플러그인이 다음을 통해 엔진의 기능을 확장할 "
"수 있습니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:40
msgid "Android platform APIs"
msgstr "Android SDK Platform 29"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:41
msgid "Android libraries"
msgstr "플랫폼 이름."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:42
msgid "Kotlin and Java libraries"
msgstr "애니메이션 트리"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:43
msgid "Native libraries (via JNI)"
msgstr "네이티브 라이브러리(JNI를 통해)"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:44
msgid "GDExtension libraries"
msgstr "능동적 개발 고려사항"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:46
msgid ""
"Each plugin has an init class extending from the `GodotPlugin <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/0a7f75ec7b465604b6496c8f5f1d638aed250d6d/"
"platform/android/java/lib/src/org/godotengine/godot/plugin/"
"GodotPlugin.java#L80>`_ class which is provided by the :ref:`Godot Android "
"library <doc_android_library>`."
msgstr ""
"각 플러그인에는 :ref:`Godot Android 라이브러리 <doc_android_library>`에서 제"
"공하는 `GodotPlugin <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/"
"0a7f75ec7b465604b6496c8f5f1d638aed250d6d/platform/android/java/lib/src/org/"
"godotengine/godot/plugin/GodotPlugin.java#L80>`_ 클래스에서 확장되는 초기화 "
"클래스가 있습니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:49
msgid ""
"The ``GodotPlugin`` class provides APIs to access the running Godot instance "
"and hook into its lifecycle. It is loaded at runtime by the Godot engine."
msgstr ""
"``GodotPlugin`` 클래스는 실행 중인 Godot 인스턴스에 액세스하고 수명 주기에 연"
"결하는 API를 제공합니다. Godot 엔진에 의해 런타임에 로드됩니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:52
msgid "v2 Packaging format"
msgstr "v2 패키징 형식"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:54
msgid ""
"v1 Android plugins required a custom ``gdap`` configuration file that was "
"used by the Godot Editor to detect and load them. However this approach had "
"several drawbacks, primary ones being that it lacked flexibility and "
"departed from the `existing Godot EditorExportPlugin format, delivery and "
"installation flow <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/plugins/"
"editor/installing_plugins.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"v1 Android 플러그인에는 Godot 편집기가 이를 감지하고 로드하는 데 사용되는 사"
"용자 정의 ``gdap`` 구성 파일이 필요합니다. 그러나 이 접근 방식에는 몇 가지 단"
"점이 있었는데, 가장 큰 이유는 유연성이 부족하고 `기존 Godot "
"EditorExportPlugin 형식, 전달 및 설치 흐름 <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/"
"stable/tutorials/plugins/editor/installing_plugins.html>`_에서 벗어났다는 것"
"입니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:58
msgid ""
"This has been resolved for v2 Android plugins by deprecating the ``gdap`` "
"packaging and configuration mechanism in favor of the existing Godot "
"``EditorExportPlugin`` packaging format. The ``EditorExportPlugin`` API in "
"turn has been extended to properly support Android plugins."
msgstr ""
"이 문제는 기존 Godot ``EditorExportPlugin`` 패키징 형식을 선호하여 ``gdap`` "
"패키징 및 구성 메커니즘을 더 이상 사용하지 않음으로써 v2 Android 플러그인에"
"서 해결되었습니다. ``EditorExportPlugin`` API는 Android 플러그인을 적절하게 "
"지원하도록 확장되었습니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:64
msgid "Building a v2 Android plugin"
msgstr "간단한 플러그인 만들기"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:66
msgid ""
"A github project template **is provided** at https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-"
"Android-Plugin-Template as a **quickstart for building Godot Android plugins "
"for Godot 4.2+**. You can follow the `template README <https://github.com/"
"m4gr3d/Godot-Android-Plugin-Template#readme>`_ to set up your own Godot "
"Android plugin project."
msgstr ""
"Github 프로젝트 템플릿은 **Godot 4.2+용 Godot Android 플러그인을 빌드하기 위"
"한 빠른 시작**으로 https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-Android-Plugin-Template에 "
"**제공**됩니다. `템플릿 README <https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-Android-"
"Plugin-Template#readme>`_을 따라 자신만의 Godot Android 플러그인 프로젝트를 "
"설정할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:71
msgid ""
"To provide further understanding, here is a break-down of the steps used to "
"create the project template:"
msgstr ""
"더 깊은 이해를 돕기 위해 프로젝트 템플릿을 만드는 데 사용되는 단계를 자세히 "
"설명합니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:73
msgid ""
"Create an Android library module using `these instructions <https://"
"developer.android.com/studio/projects/android-library>`_"
msgstr ""
"실행한 뒤 `설명 <https://developer.android.com/studio/intro/update#sdk-"
"manager>`__ 을 참고해 SDK 설정을 마치세요."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:75
msgid ""
"Add the Godot Android library as a dependency by updating the module's "
"``gradle`` `build file <https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-Android-Plugin-"
"Template/blob/main/plugin/build.gradle.kts#L42>`_:"
msgstr ""
"모듈의 ``gradle`` `빌드 파일 <https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-Android-Plugin-"
"Template/blob/main/plugin/build.gradle.kts#L42>`_을 업데이트하여 Godot "
"Android 라이브러리를 종속성으로 추가하세요."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:83
msgid ""
"The Godot Android library is `hosted on MavenCentral <https://"
"central.sonatype.com/artifact/org.godotengine/godot>`_, and updated for each "
"release."
msgstr ""
"Godot Android 라이브러리는 `MavenCentral <https://central.sonatype.com/"
"artifact/org.godotengine/godot>`_에서 호스팅되며 각 릴리스마다 업데이트됩니"
"다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:85
msgid ""
"Create `GodotAndroidPlugin <https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-Android-Plugin-"
"Template/blob/a01286b4cb459133bf07b11dfabdfd3980268797/plugin/src/main/java/"
"org/godotengine/plugin/android/template/GodotAndroidPlugin.kt#L10>`_, an "
"init class for the plugin extending `GodotPlugin <https://github.com/"
"godotengine/godot/blob/0a7f75ec7b465604b6496c8f5f1d638aed250d6d/platform/"
"android/java/lib/src/org/godotengine/godot/plugin/GodotPlugin.java#L80>`_."
msgstr ""
"만들기 `GodotAndroidPlugin <https://github.com/m4gr3d/Godot-Android-Plugin-"
"Template/blob/a01286b4cb459133bf07b11dfabdfd3980268797/plugin/src/main/java/"
"org/godotengine/plugin/android/template/GodotAndroidPlugin.kt#L10>`_, "
"`GodotPlugin <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/"
"0a7f75ec7b465604b6496c8f5f1d638aed250d6d/platform/android/java/lib/src/org/"
"godotengine/godot/plugin/GodotPlugin.java#L80>`_ 확장 플러그인용 초기화 클래"
"스입니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:87
msgid ""
"If the plugin exposes Kotlin or Java methods to be called from GDScript, "
"they must be annotated with `@UsedByGodot <https://github.com/godotengine/"
"godot/blob/0a7f75ec7b465604b6496c8f5f1d638aed250d6d/platform/android/java/"
"lib/src/org/godotengine/godot/plugin/UsedByGodot.java#L45>`_. The name "
"called from GDScript **must match the method name exactly**. There is **no** "
"coercing ``snake_case`` to ``camelCase``. For example, from GDScript:"
msgstr ""
"플러그인이 GDScript에서 호출할 Kotlin 또는 Java 메서드를 노출하는 경우 "
"`@UsedByGodot <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/"
"0a7f75ec7b465604b6496c8f5f1d638aed250d6d/platform/android/java/lib/src/org/"
"godotengine/godot/plugin/UsedByGodot.java#L45>`_ 주석을 달아야 합니다. "
"GDScript에서 호출되는 이름은 **메서드 이름과 정확히 일치해야 합니다**. "
"``snake_case``를 ``camelCase``로 강제 변환하는 **없음**이 없습니다. 예를 들"
"어, GDScript에서:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:95
msgid ""
"If the plugin uses `signals <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/"
"getting_started/step_by_step/signals.html>`_, the init class must return the "
"set of signals used by overriding `GodotPlugin::getPluginSignals() <https://"
"github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/fa3428ff25bc577d2a3433090478a6d615567056/"
"platform/android/java/lib/src/org/godotengine/godot/plugin/"
"GodotPlugin.java#L302>`_. To emit signals, the plugin can use the "
"`GodotPlugin::emitSignal(...) method <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"blob/0a7f75ec7b465604b6496c8f5f1d638aed250d6d/platform/android/java/lib/src/"
"org/godotengine/godot/plugin/GodotPlugin.java#L317>`_."
msgstr ""
"플러그인이 `시그널 <https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/getting_started/"
"step_by_step/signals.html>`_를 사용하는 경우 init 클래스는 "
"`GodotPlugin::getPluginSignals() <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/"
"fa3428ff25bc577d2a3433090478a6d615567056/platform/android/java/lib/src/org/"
"godotengine/godot/plugin/GodotPlugin.java#L302>`_을 재정의하여 사용되는 시그"
"널 세트를 반환해야 합니다. 시그널를 내보내려면 플러그인에서 "
"`GodotPlugin::emitSignal(...) 메서드 <https://github.com/godotengine/godot/"
"blob/0a7f75ec7b465604b6496c8f5f1d638aed250d6d/platform/android/java/lib/src/"
"org/godotengine/godot/plugin/GodotPlugin.java#L317>`_을 사용할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:97
msgid ""
"Update the plugin ``AndroidManifest.xml`` `file <https://github.com/m4gr3d/"
"Godot-Android-Plugin-Template/blob/main/plugin/src/main/"
"AndroidManifest.xml>`_ with the following meta-data:"
msgstr ""
"다음 메타데이터로 플러그인 ``AndroidManifest.xml`` `file <https://github.com/"
"m4gr3d/Godot-Android-Plugin-Template/blob/main/plugin/src/main/"
"AndroidManifest.xml>`_을 업데이트합니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/platform/android/android_plugin.rst:106
msgid "Where:"
