#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:120
msgid ""
"String as a path to a file, custom filter provided as hint. See "
"again :ref:`@export_file <class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_file>`."
msgstr ""
"파일 경로인 문자열, 힌트로 제공되는 사용자 정의 필터. :ref:`@export_file "
"<class_@GDScript_annotation_@export_file>`을 다시 참조하세요."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/gdscript/gdscript_exports.rst:126
#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_exports.rst:198
msgid ""
"Using paths in the global filesystem is also possible, but only in scripts "
