"요 :ref:`doc_gdscript_onready_keyword`)로 호출될 때까지 멤버 변수의 초기화를 "
"연기할 수 있습니다:"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/scripting/c_sharp/c_sharp_differences.rst:332
msgid ""
"However C# does not have this ability. To achieve the same effect you need "
