msgstr "**벡터3**, **색상**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1225
msgid "When Color is used, it will be interpreted as (r, g, b)."
msgstr "Color를 사용하면 (r, g, b)로 해석됩니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1227
msgid "**Vector4**, **Color**, **Rect2**, **Plane**, **Quaternion**"
msgstr "**벡터4**, **색상**, **Rect2**, **평면**, **쿼터니언**"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1227
msgid "When Color is used, it will be interpreted as (r, g, b, a)."
msgstr "Color를 사용하면 (r, g, b, a)로 해석됩니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1229
