"When Rect2 is used, it will be interpreted as (position.x, position.y, "
"size.x, size.y)."
msgstr ""
"Rect2를 사용하면 (position.x, position.y, size.x, size.y)로 해석됩니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1232
