msgid ":ref:`Particle shaders <doc_particle_shader>`"
msgstr ":ref:`doc_particle_shader`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1307
msgid ":ref:`Sky shaders <doc_sky_shader>`"
msgstr ":ref:`doc_spatial_shader`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1308
msgid ":ref:`Fog shaders <doc_fog_shader>`"
msgstr ":ref:`doc_spatial_shader`"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shading_language.rst:1313
msgid ""
"A large number of built-in functions are supported, conforming to GLSL ES "
"3.0. See the :ref:`Built-in functions <doc_shader_functions>` page for "
