msgstr "최종 결과물"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1286
msgid "The second value to be multiplied."
msgstr "곱할 두 번째 값입니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1289
msgid "The value to be added to the result."
msgstr "파일의 절대 경로"

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1292
msgid "The value of ``a * b + c``."
msgstr "``a * b + c``의 값입니다."

#: ../../docs/tutorials/shaders/shader_reference/shader_functions.rst:1294
