#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:547
msgid ""
"Compile the engine with ``scons tests=yes``, and run the tests with the "
"following command:"
msgstr ""
"``scons tests=yes``로 엔진을 컴파일하고 다음 명령을 사용하여 테스트를 실행합"
"니다."

#: ../../docs/engine_details/engine_api/custom_modules_in_cpp.rst:554
msgid "You should see the passing assertions now."
